static const char *db_chat(const DockAd *a){static const char *s[]={"I fitted this before a very hot trip. The engine stayed cool. I did not. Anyway, how's your ship treating you?","Every box I sell is one less box to carry. My crew have invented an impressive number of excuses to avoid helping.","It really is a good laser. I just need a fresh start, preferably somewhere my ex doesn't know the docking code.","I've kept the exact figures with it. A collector should know what they're buying, particularly after a long journey.","Thanks for stopping! I was worried I'd press the wrong button and sell my entire ship.","No timer, no trick. Buy a batch, make some room, and I'll still be here with the rest.","Those minerals are properly weighed. I can't promise the cargo stops rattling, but I can promise the price.","I'm a mechanic, Commander. This part does what its figures say. Worn parts stay worn; I won't pretend otherwise.","I pay for the cargo you choose to sell. Anything promised to someone else stays in your hold.","Yes, it's a good deal. Sometimes I like getting someone else excited about a piece of kit.","The advertised part comes first. I also have another real listing here if you'd like to browse it.","Crew life is mostly checking straps, making tea, and discovering who finished the tea. Still, it beats an office.","It's nice hearing a real voice. I spend days talking to my kettle. You're a much better conversationalist.","Every worn part is labelled honestly. Cheaper, weaker, permanent. You deserve to know exactly what you're buying.","It's travelled a long way with me. Take a look at the figures before you decide; there is no deadline.","A ship needs looking after. Mine has developed a rattle that sounds oddly like a disappointed parent.","You can always say no, Commander. Nothing changes hands until you accept the offer on the screen.","Recovered the part beside that wreck. The salvage out there is separate; you're paying only for this module.","My crew are the ships alongside me. Hail my named ship for the sale. They're very enthusiastic about lunch.","Good to see your ship again. I keep previous deals on record and advertise fresh stock separately."};return s[a->encounter];}
